- NATO defence expenditure figures: North Atlantic Treaty Organization.
- Exchange rates: European Central Bank euro foreign exchange reference rates, via Frankfurter.
- News headlines link to their publishers (BBC, The Guardian, NPR, Al Jazeera, Deutsche Welle, CNBC, ECB, Federal
